---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Just Block Privacy Policy">
    <h1>Just Block Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
        <em>Last updated: September 15, 2026</em>
    </p>

    <p>
        Just Block ("the App") is a DNS-based ad and tracker blocking
        application. We are committed to keeping the App private and minimizing
        the information it handles.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
        Just Block does not collect, store, or sell personal information about
        its users.
    </p>
    <p>
        We do not operate servers that receive or store information from the
        App, and we do not use analytics, advertising SDKs, or user accounts.
    </p>

    <h2>VPN and DNS Traffic</h2>
    <p>
        Just Block uses Android's <code>VpnService</code> API to create a local
        VPN connection on your device. The VPN is used to inspect and process
        network traffic for the purpose of DNS-based blocking.
    </p>
    <p>
        DNS queries are processed locally by the App. Just Block does not store
        your DNS queries or browsing history.
    </p>
    <p>
        To resolve DNS queries, the App sends them to AdGuard's default DNS
        server at
        <code>94.140.14.14</code>. We chose AdGuard as it is a popular
        privacy-oriented DNS provider that supports DNS over QUIC. Routing
        queries through this DNS server also has the benefit of blocking many
        advertising domains by default. AdGuard's default DNS server is open to
        the public and free to use. We are not affiliated with AdGuard in any
        way.
    </p>
    <p>
        AdGuard's handling of DNS queries is governed by its own privacy
        practices. Please review
        <a href="https://adguard.com/en/privacy.html">
            AdGuard's Privacy Policy
        </a>
        for more information.
    </p>

    <h2>Information Stored on Your Device</h2>
    <p>
        Just Block stores configuration information locally on your device. This
        may include:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Blocking preferences</li>
        <li>DNS configuration</li>
        <li>Enabled or disabled blocklists</li>
        <li>User-configured blocklist URLs</li>
        <li>Other application settings</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This information is not transmitted to Just Block's servers.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Blocklists</h2>
    <p>
        Just Block allows you to configure URLs from which third-party
        blocklists can be downloaded. Use this feature at your own risk.
    </p>
    <p>
        When you enable a blocklist, your device connects directly to the
        configured URL to download the blocklist. These third-party websites are
        not operated or controlled by Just Block, and their privacy practices
        are governed by their respective privacy policies.
    </p>
    <p>Only use blocklist sources that you trust.</p>

    <h2>Data Sharing and Sale</h2>
    <p>
        Just Block does not sell, rent, or share user information with third
        parties.
    </p>
    <p>
        The App may communicate directly with third-party DNS providers and
        blocklist hosts when required to provide its functionality. These
        services may receive information associated with those network requests,
        such as DNS queries or your device's network address. Their handling of
        that information is governed by their respective privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
    <p>Just Block does not retain user data on servers.</p>
    <p>
        Application configuration is stored locally on your device. You can
        remove this information by clearing the App's data or uninstalling the
        App.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
        Just Block does not knowingly collect personal information from
        children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy when the App's functionality or data
        practices change. Any updated version will be posted at this location
        with a new "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or Just Block's privacy
        practices, please contact us at:
        <a href="mailto:justfreesoftwarema@gmail.com">
            justfreesoftwarema@gmail.com
        </a>
    </p>
</Layout>
